name: sim.getMatchingPersistentDataTags
description: Deprecated. See sim.readCustomDataTags instead.
luaSynopsis: list tags = sim.getMatchingPersistentDataTags(string pattern)
pythonSynopsis: string[] tags = sim.getMatchingPersistentDataTags(string pattern)
inputs:
1. pattern: the pattern to match. e.g. "Commander\.options\.s".
outputs:
1. tags: an array containing the retrieved data tags
